# Squarespace Compatibility

A shared compatibility library for SERV Squarespace websites.

## Files

### squarespace-fix.css
Contains CSS compatibility fixes for Squarespace platform updates.

### squarespace-fix.js
Contains JavaScript compatibility fixes for Squarespace platform updates.

## Usage

Add to Squarespace Header Injection:

```html
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/codemilk-io/squarespace-scripts@main/squarespace-fix.css">
<script defer src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/codemilk-io/squarespace-scripts@main/squarespace-fix.js"></script>
```

## Changelog

### v1.0.0
- Initial compatibility release
- Flexbox compatibility for new `.page-regions`
- Backwards compatibility with `#sections`
- Mobile stacking compatibility
- `data-current-styles` normalisation
